Aim

To develop an online cake ordering system for browsing, ordering, and tracking cake deliveries.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search and filter cakes by category and price.
View cake details and add cakes to the cart.
Enter the shipping address and place the order.
Make payment and track the order status.
Admin manages cakes, products, orders, and delivery details.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online cake ordering system was designed to manage cake selection, online ordering, payments, and delivery tracking efficiently.
